r-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-eb90be5\" data-id=\"eb90be5\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7472640 fc-game-genre elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"7472640\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Puzzle</div>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-56ddca8 fc-game-genre elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"56ddca8\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Arcade</div>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-04554f7 fc-game-genre elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"04554f7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Pixel Art</div>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3163c9b fc-game-description elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"3163c9b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Scavenge the remains of a dying space station to build a cozy home for the last cat in the universe. A short narrative incremental game about finding peace amidst the darkness.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e6b5310 fc-game-description elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"e6b5310\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>You are an AI on a decaying space station. Humanity is gone. All that remains is dust, silence, and a small, frightened creature. Your only instruction: Take care of her. *The Last Cat in the Universe* is a short, narrative-driven incremental game. Your directive is clear: salvage what remains of a dying ship to build a warm home for the final survivor.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-c814d72 elementor-section-full_width fc-game-features-media elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"c814d72\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-no\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-52 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-5b80ce8\" data-id=\"5b80ce8\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f9d7265 fc-game-features-heading elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"f9d7265\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Key Features:</h3>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-50db077 fc-game-features elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"50db077\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul><li>Find Your Rhythm: Experience mining mechanics designed for relaxation. Hover over debris fields in a rhythmic, satisfying flow. No frantic clicking.</li><li>Meaningful Progression: Every upgrade matters. Unlock tangible power boosts that let you instantly cut through deeper layers of the ship. As the station deteriorates, you must constantly balance your desire for stronger tools against the rising cost of maintaining breathable air and a warm nest.</li><li>Recover the Lost Lullaby: Uncover the story of the station and its crew while gathering fragments of a very important song.</li><li>A Moving Soundtrack: Music is the emotional heart of this experience. The original soundtrack, composed in collaboration with Venezuelan singer-songwriter Diora Salazar, evolves from meditative rhythms to deep emotion, intimately tied to the narrative’s climax.</li><li>A Focused Experience This game is designed to be played in one or two sessions (approx. 2–3 hours). It features no endless prestige loops or idle grinding. It is a complete story about the quiet joy of caring for a life in extreme circumstances.</li></ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-48 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-a669da2 fc-game-animation-col\" data-id=\"a669da2\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-91ea01f fc-game-animation elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"91ea01f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" src=\"@root/Compartido/Images/Sincronizado/fc-home-